---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../data/config.json";
import faqs from "../../data/faqs.json";
const meta = {"url": "/bench-plaque-wording-ideas/", "title": "Bench Plaque Wording Ideas | Grimes Engravers", "description": "Ideas for memorial bench plaque wording, including Welsh and bilingual phrases, celebration plaques and tips for clear, readable plaques."};
---
<Base image="/assets/img/bench-plaque.jpg" title={meta.title} description={meta.description} path={meta.url} faqs={faqs["bench-plaque-wording-ideas"]} scripts={[]}>
<section style="background: #F5F6F7; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto">
<p style="margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #C8202A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase">Guide</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.15">Bench plaque wording ideas</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #4B5563">Finding the right words is often the hardest part. Here are examples families have chosen, plus tips on keeping the wording clear and readable.</p>
</div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><div style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto">
<div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #1F2933">Classic memorial wording</h2><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem"><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">In loving memory of
Margaret Jones
1938 – 2024</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">In memory of
John Davies
who loved this place</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Forever loved
and never forgotten</li></ul></div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #1F2933">For someone who loved the spot</h2><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem"><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Who loved this view</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Sit, rest and remember
David Evans</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">She loved to sit here
and watch the world go by</li></ul></div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #1F2933">Welsh &amp; bilingual</h2><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem"><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Er cof annwyl am
(In loving memory of)</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Am byth yn ein calonnau
(Forever in our hearts)</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Nos da Mam a Dad
(Goodnight Mum and Dad)</li></ul></div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #1F2933">Celebrations &amp; gifts</h2><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem"><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Presented to mark
50 years of marriage</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Donated by the members of
[Club name], 2026</li><li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-line">Happy retirement
Enjoy the view</li></ul></div>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Tips for good wording</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Keep it short</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Fewer words mean larger, easier-to-read letters, especially on smaller plaques.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Check the limits</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Council schemes often limit the number of lines or characters, so check before you finalise.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Spell-check names &amp; dates</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Ask a second family member to read it. We’ll send a proof, but you approve the text.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Welsh accents</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">We engrave Welsh characters such as ŵ and ŷ correctly.</p></div></div>
<p style="margin: 2rem 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem"><a href="/plaque-fonts/" style="font-weight: 700">Try your wording in our fonts →</a></p>
</div></div></section>
<section style="background: #3D5A5E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 24rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600">Happy with your wording?</h2><p style="margin: 0; color: #E5ECEC">Send it to us and we’ll email a proof showing exactly how it will look.</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem"><a href="/contact/" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px">Request a quote</a>
<a href="mailto:info@grimesengravers.com" style="border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Email us</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
